# Example apps (aspnet/Tide.Asgard.AspNetCore/Examples)
# On Linux the JavaScript project SDK writes to a folder literally named "obj\Debug", which obj/ does not match
obj\\*/
# Their lockfiles link to a local tidecloak-js checkout, so they differ from machine to machine
aspnet/Tide.Asgard.AspNetCore/Examples/**/package-lock.json
